# .dockerignore for the wax-rng-oracle image.
# COPY honours THIS file, not .gitignore — so anything key-shaped must be excluded HERE
# or it gets baked into the image layers and is extractable from the registry.
#
# INVARIANT: the image bakes NO secrets. Real keys/config arrive ONLY at runtime through
# the environment (config/custom-environment-variables.json maps it over default.json).
# Keep ONLY those two config files; exclude every dev/test config that carries mnemonics,
# RSA threshold private shares, or chain keys.
#
# IMPORTANT: Docker's .dockerignore parser supports ONLY full-line `#` comments — an inline
# / trailing comment is taken as part of the pattern and silently neuters it. Keep every
# comment on its own line.

# VCS / CI / editor / docs (history can carry rotated key material; none needed at runtime)
.git
.gitignore
.gitlab-ci.yml
.github
.idea
*.md
docs
Dockerfile*
.dockerignore

# Deps + build/test/coverage artifacts (deps reinstalled via npm ci; build runs in-image)
node_modules
.nyc_output
coverage
public
benchmark/log
test
/local_test
db*.json
testdb*.json

# CUSTODY: key-shaped material — NEVER copy into the image.
# config/local{1,2,3}.json: local-dev chain configs (mnemonics + RSA shares + EOS WIFs)
config/local*.json
# config/test.json: test fixture (EOS WIF + threshold share)
config/test.json
# config/threshold-keys-test.json: aggregated RSA threshold private shares
config/threshold-keys-test.json
# resources/: holds rsa_4096_priv.pem (real key, only .gitignore-protected)
resources/
.env

# NOTE: intentionally NOT excluded (required at build/runtime):
#   config/default.json, config/custom-environment-variables.json  (runtime config + env mapping)
#   index.js, lib/, webpack.config.js, package.json, package-lock.json  (app + build)
# Every dependency installs from the public npm registry (Dockerfile_eks refuses anything else).

# Not needed in the image; the benchmark scripts carry a dev-chain key literal.
benchmark/
# Local-only files that .gitignore covers but COPY would not (a working-tree build).
*.pem
.npmrc
.env.*
terraform/
packages/
*.tgz
.venv/
junk/
